{"id":"4ef997f21686d868","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-conservativity-chain.md","title":"Conservative Extensions Compose","display":"thm-conservativity-chain — Conservative Extensions Compose","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-conservativity-chain","aliases":["67-thm-conservativity-chain"],"display":"thm-conservativity-chain — Conservative Extensions Compose","depends_on":["[[67-df-partially-conservative]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":5,"source_label":"local consequence of conservative-extension definition","source_printed_pages":"66","source_pdf_pages":"77","source_proof_status":"上述有限证明替换及两次后果转移已检查"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-conservativity-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-conservativity-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-conservativity-chain — Conservative Extensions Compose"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"local consequence of conservative-extension definition"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"66"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"77"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"上述有限证明替换及两次后果转移已检查"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1,T_2,T_3\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T_1,T_2,T_3\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a> 的演绎扩张定义，不要求三个公理呈示字面嵌套。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_2,T_1)\\land\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_3,T_2)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_3,T_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_2,T_1)\\land\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_3,T_2)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_3,T_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_3\">\\(T_3\\)</span> 证明每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span> 公理，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span> 证明每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span> 公理，将有限证明中的公理逐一替换便得演绎扩张；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 后果先从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_3\">\\(T_3\\)</span> 转到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span> 再转到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这是来源保守扩张定义的直接推论，没有冒称原书独立编号定理。旧稿要求字面包含的三个公理集现已放宽为真实的演绎扩张接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma$ 取 [[67-df-partially-conservative]] 的演绎扩张定义，不要求三个公理呈示字面嵌套。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T_1,T_2,T_3\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_2,T_1)\\land\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_3,T_2)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T_3,T_1).","display":true},{"tex":"T_3","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"T_3","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-conservativity-chain]]"}],"outgoing":["5d04e3c8a5885c18"]}